+# CR-0051: A setting changed by chat is not also saved as a memory
+
+- **Asked by:** Vikas, 2026-10-21 07:14Z (project chat): "keep on doing the end-to-end testing until you see that everything is
+  working … Do not wait for any go or approval from me". The real-AI run 30 on main 04f01dd (Claude CLI, journey U17) found
+  it. The coordinator passed it on 2026-10-22 at 01:14Z and said go at 01:34Z.
+- **Why:** "Switch to dark mode" changed the theme and showed "Changed: Theme → Dark. Undo" (CR-0043). About 20 s later the
+  post-turn review (08-3 §12.4) read the same message and saved "Prefers dark mode". The run's app log shows
+  `memory.saved_said`.
+  - The words were an instruction to foo, not a fact about the user, and the setting line already records them.
+  - Undo of the theme took the setting back but left the fact, so foo "remembered" a preference the user had undone.
+- **Spec sections:** 08-3 §12.4 Input; DECISIONS X-209.
+- **Status:** Approved by Vikas's approve-on-my-behalf rule, DECISIONS X-209 (his messages 2026-10-18 14:56Z and 14:59Z,
+  and 2026-10-21 07:14Z), after the independent review in §(d).
+- **Change:** the sections above, as listed in §(b).
+- **Manifest:** `pnpm tsx scripts/spec-verify.ts --write` runs in the same commit.
+
+## (a) Trace rows
+
+None. The tests are in `test/integration/setting-not-memory.test.ts` ("CR-0051 · …").
+
+## (b) Spec before → after
+
+| #   | What the run saw                          | Spec before                                   | Spec after                                                         |
+| --- | ----------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |
+| 1   | "Switch to dark mode" also saved a memory | §12.4 Input: every new message since the last | the same, leaving out a user message whose intake kind was setting |
+
+## (c) Proof
+
+- `test/integration/setting-not-memory.test.ts` fails on main and passes with the change.
+  - Run 30 U17: the theme changes and no fact or chip is saved. The review never reads the message.
+  - A later "I'm vegetarian" in the same chat is still reviewed and saved.
+- The change is one line in the chat lane (`memory.skipReview`), reusing the J17 "don't remember this" skip.
+
+## (d) Review
+
+Pending.
